{"id":"HKF-128","kind":"technical","key":"t3_platform_modality","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"Physical testbed evaluation (not simulation): 24 airborne computers (20 Jetson Nano, 2 Jetson TX2, 2 Jetson NX) over WiFi indoors, 5 real quad-rotor UAVs (4 Nano, 1 NX) over Ad-hoc outdoors, RTX 3060 ground station, Python+TensorRT.","evidence":[{"page":10,"section":"VIII.A Evaluation Setup","quote":"We have deployed ASAP on 24 UAV airborne"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-013","kind":"appraisal","key":"D01","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"YES: Section III.A–C clearly defines the UAV-swarm collaborative CNN inference problem, ad-hoc swarm model, layer/subtask decomposition, binary nonlinear latency-minimization formulation (P1), and greedy online heuristic (EECIA).","evidence":[{"page":3,"section":"III.A System Model","quote":"we consider that the calculation of one layer"}],"note":""}
